sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Gateway / Ingress<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant HR as HTTPRoute /<br/>VirtualService
    participant Svc as K8s Service<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Init as storage-initializer<br/>(Init Container)
    participant Pred as Predictor Pod<br/>8080/TCP
    participant S3 as Storage Backend<br/>(S3/GCS/HF/Azure)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: InferenceService Model Serving (Standard/Raw Mode)

    Init->>S3: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Backend credentials (IAM/GCP/Azure/HF Token)
    S3-->>Init: Model artifacts

    Client->>GW: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: None or Bearer Token
    GW->>HR: Route to backend service
    HR->>Svc: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8080 (cluster-internal)
    Svc->>Pred: Inference request<br/>HTTP/8080
    Pred-->>Svc: Prediction response
    Svc-->>HR: Response
    HR-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Client: JSON Response

    participant GW2 as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant HR2 as HTTPRoute →<br/>InferencePool
    participant EPP as Scheduler (EPP)<br/>gRPC
    participant VLLM as Workload Pod (vLLM)<br/>8000/TCP
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>9090/TCP

    Note over Client,Prom: Flow 2: LLMInferenceService Serving (RHOAI 3.x)

    Client->>GW2: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer / OAuth
    GW2->>HR2: Route via HTTPRoute
    HR2->>EPP: Endpoint picking<br/>gRPC mTLS (DestinationRule)
    EPP->>VLLM: Forward to selected pod<br/>HTTP or HTTPS/8000<br/>TLS (self-signed)
    VLLM-->>EPP: LLM response
    EPP-->>HR2: Response
    HR2-->>GW2: Response
    GW2-->>Client: Streaming/JSON Response

    Prom->>VLLM: Scrape metrics<br/>PodMonitor HTTPS/8000<br/>insecureSkipVerify
    Prom->>EPP: Scrape metrics<br/>ServiceMonitor HTTP<br/>Bearer token auth

    participant LMCtrl as LocalModel Controller
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant LMAgent as LocalModelNode Agent
    participant DLJob as Download Job Pod
    participant Store as Storage Backend<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over LMCtrl,Store: Flow 3: LocalModel Cache Download

    LMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch LocalModelCache CRs<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS<br/>ServiceAccount token
    LMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create PV/PVC resources
    K8sAPI-->>LMCtrl: Resources created
    LMAgent->>K8sAPI: Watch LocalModelNode CRs
    LMAgent->>DLJob: Create download Job
    DLJob->>Store: Download model<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Backend credentials
    Store-->>DLJob: Model artifacts
    DLJob-->>LMAgent: Job completed
